  m_text: "Hey, can you help me for a moment?\n\nI just received a few messages claiming
    to be from my bank. They said there was suspicious activity on my account and
    that I needed to take action immediately.\n\nI\u2019m worried I might click the
    wrong link or block an important message by mistake.\n\nCan you help me check
    which ones are suspicious and which ones are safe?"
